<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-text align="center" color="#202020" font-family="Sora, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif" />
      <mj-section background-color="#fff" />
      <mj-button
        background-color="#7a00b8"
        color="#fff"
        font-family="bernhard-gothic-urw, Sora, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif"
        font-size="20px"
        font-weight="bold"
        text-transform="uppercase"
        inner-padding="20px 22px"
        line-height="1.3"
      />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-font name="bernhard-gothic-urw" href="https://use.typekit.net/bjy5uxp.css" />
    <mj-font name="Sora" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@400;700&display=swap" />
    <mj-preview
      >The BPETS Token Presale is getting closer on Saturday, June 22 2024, 17:00 UTC! Our presale page is already live
      on PinkSale, so you will be able to buy BPETS there as soon as it opens at a price of 1 SOL = 25K BPETS (50% less
      than last announced), with a max. circulating supply of 58M tokens!</mj-preview
    >
    <mj-style>@media screen and (max-width: 480px) { .heading-text div { font-size: 28px !important; } } </mj-style>
    <mj-title>The BPETS Presale Is Close!</mj-title>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#f8eeff">
    <mj-section background-color="#4e0075" padding-bottom="0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          href="https://www.battlepets.io"
          width="80px"
          src="https://imagedelivery.net/tQX6spJrZdgf00cBsxL4kQ/3e1bb9cc-3078-4c49-42e4-577b8996d000/public"
          alt="Battlepets logo"
          padding-top="0"
        />
        <mj-text
          css-class="heading-text"
          align="center"
          color="#fff"
          font-family="bernhard-gothic-urw, Sora, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif"
          font-size="36px"
          font-weight="bold"
          line-height="1.3"
          >The <span style="color: #d000ff">BPETS Presale</span> Is Close!</mj-text
        >
        <mj-image
          width="600px"
          src="https://imagedelivery.net/tQX6spJrZdgf00cBsxL4kQ/e98509a8-55b7-4b24-1a5f-e5be39168000/public"
          alt="Battlepets cards"
          padding="0"
        />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section>
      <mj-column padding-left="6.5%" padding-right="6.5%" padding-bottom="30px">
        <mj-text font-size="16px" line-height="1.5" align="left">
          <p>
            The <strong>BPETS Token Presale</strong> is getting closer on
            <strong><span style="color: #c324dd">Saturday, June 22 2024, 17:00 UTC</span></strong
            >!
          </p>
          <p>
            Our presale page is already live on
            <a
              href="https://www.pinksale.finance/solana/launchpad/7JKzneYgmVCTcokGhMNmehE5jua92YZkgiEMZZzDxTs1"
              style="color: #7a00b8; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"
              >PinkSale</a
            >, so you will be able to buy BPETS there as soon as it opens at a price of
            <strong>1 SOL = 25K BPETS</strong> (<strong>50% less</strong> than last announced), with a max. circulating
            supply of 58M tokens!
          </p>
          <p>
            The maximum sale duration will be <strong>72 hours</strong>, and <strong>no whitelisting</strong> is needed!
          </p>
          <p>
            You can find more details on the
            <a
              href="https://www.pinksale.finance/solana/launchpad/7JKzneYgmVCTcokGhMNmehE5jua92YZkgiEMZZzDxTs1"
              style="color: #7a00b8; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"
              >presale page</a
            >, and
            <a
              href="https://medium.com/@battlepets_game/bpets-presale-how-to-buy-2b6113381b21"
              style="color: #7a00b8; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"
              >read our Medium article with the full presale details</a
            >.
          </p>
          <p>
            Right after the sale, the token will be listed for trading at a higher price than the presale (<strong
              >1 SOL ≈ 26K BPETS</strong
            >), so make sure you don’t miss out!
          </p>
          <p>
            All presale participants will also later be aidropped a <strong>sale-only, limited edition</strong> NFT
            card: the <strong><span style="color: #fa2d14">Inferno</span> Hellcat</strong>!
          </p>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-image
          width="280px"
          src="https://imagedelivery.net/tQX6spJrZdgf00cBsxL4kQ/1e2f2fbe-f42e-48e9-da71-8271f5c2e700/public"
          alt="Inferno Hellcat card"
          padding="0"
        />
        <mj-text font-size="16px" line-height="1.5" align="left">
          <p>We hope to see you there on <strong>June 22</strong>!</p>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.pinksale.finance/solana/launchpad/7JKzneYgmVCTcokGhMNmehE5jua92YZkgiEMZZzDxTs1"
          >Join The Presale</mj-button
        >
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section background-color="#f8eeff" padding-bottom="4px">
      <mj-group>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-image
            href="https://t.me/battlepets_game"
            alt="Telegram logo"
            align="right"
            height="44px"
            width="44px"
            padding-left="6px"
            padding-right="6px"
            src="https://imagedelivery.net/tQX6spJrZdgf00cBsxL4kQ/c5e8f177-28e1-4f92-3380-36f34a961d00/public"
          />
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-image
            href="https://twitter.com/battlepets_game"
            alt="X logo"
            align="left"
            padding-left="6px"
            padding-right="6px"
            height="44px"
            width="44px"
            src="https://imagedelivery.net/tQX6spJrZdgf00cBsxL4kQ/aef63962-4b4b-47b0-b518-1110a8ebdd00/public"
          />
        </mj-column>
      </mj-group>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section
      background-color="#f8eeff"
      padding-top="0"
      padding-left="10px"
      padding-right="10px"
      padding-bottom="40px"
    >
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text color="#883fbc" font-size="12px" padding="2px" line-height="1.5"
          >Sent by
          <a href="https://www.battlepets.io" style="color: #d000ff; text-decoration: underline">Battlepets</a
          >.</mj-text
        >
        <mj-text color="#883fbc" font-size="12px" padding="2px" line-height="1.5"
          >© 2024 Battlepets. All rights reserved. |
          <a
            href="{{{ pm:unsubscribe }}}"
            style="
              color: #d000ff;
              font-family:
                Sora,
                Helvetica Neue,
                Helvetica,
                sans-serif;
              text-decoration: underline;
            "
            >Unsubscribe</a
          >
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
